                      "String": "1,4,4,7a-tetramethyl-2,4,5,7a-tetrahydro-1H-inden-2-ol is a member of the class of indenes that is 2,4,5,7a-tetrahydro-1H-indene substituted by methyl groups at positions 1, 4, 4 and 7a and by a hydroxy group at position 2. It has a role as a flavouring agent. It is an indene and a secondary allylic alcohol.",
